    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Background: Original from America in the Earth era. When the Blue Abyss
    happened Ryan was working near the shelter. He soon hid in the shelter and survived
    during the Blue Abyss. Ryan then joined the OHS with an invitation (Invitor:
    Frank) since he had previously worked as a fisherman and chef. Oshelter. He soon
    hid in the shelter and survived during the Blue Abyss. Ryan then joined the OHS
    with an invitation (Invitor: Frank) since he had previously worked as a fisherman
    and chef. Oshelter. He soon hid in the shelter and survived during the Blue Abyss.
    Ryan then joined the OHS with an invitation (Invitor: Frank) since he had previously
    worked as a fisherman and chef. OHS provided him a floating island in Twilight
    Marine and he\u2019s responsible for providing food each month for people with
    special conditions. Ryan never married in his life. He is now under the control
    of Atlas in area 7. \t\nBackground: Original from America in the Earth era. When
    the Blue Abyss happened Ryan was working near the shelter. He soon hid in the
    shelter and survived during the Blue Abyss. Ryan then joined the OHS with an
    invitation (Invitor: Frank) since he had previously worked as a fisherman and
    chef. OHS provided him a floating island in Twilight Marine and he\u2019s responsible
    for providing food each month for people with special conditions. Ryan never
    married in his life. He is now under the control of Atlas in area 7. \t\nBackground:
    Original from America in the Earth era. When the Blue Abyss happened Ryan was
    working near the shelter. He soon hid in the shelter and survived during the
    Blue Abyss. Ryan then joined the OHS with an invitation (Invitor: Frank) since
    he had previously worked as a fisherman and chef. OHS provided him a floating
    island in Twilight Marine and he\u2019s responsible for providing food each month
    for people with special conditions. Ryan never married in his life. He is now
    under the control of Atlas in area 7. \t\n"
